# Shared project guidance

Before planning or editing, read `AGENTS.md`, `tickets/README.md`, and the
ticket being worked on. `AGENTS.md` is the canonical rule set for this project.
Do not duplicate or override it in this Cursor rule. Use the reusable
procedures under `.agents/skills/` when their descriptions match the task.
